[gd_scene format=3]

; The Threshold, under the Foundry's vents (map offset (393, -175)): the gate through the heat, where the foundry's basalt
; gives way to machinery older than any machine's memory. The vents drop the pilgrim into a column of heat rising from a
; grate in the floor, wall to roof, and on through the hatch into the Foundry's shaft; ledges in it climb back (Heat
; plating both ways). East of it a great ring stands in the hall like a gate, still turning; a shrine,
; and the door on to the Mantle.

